the concept of the digital canvas.

23
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:49,029
He believed that creativity
emerges from simplicity,

24
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:54,079
constraining the canvas to 100 by 100
pixels and restricting the colors to

25
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,159
grayscale.

26
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,399
In 2001, 25 years ago, Casey Reas
and Ben Fry, two of his students,

27
00:02:02,479 --> 00:02:07,520
after teaching Design by Numbers
